{"name":"バスティオン","description":"オムニック・クライシスの前線で戦った経験を持つロボット。その後、好奇心旺盛なバスティオンは自然に惹かれ、世界を探索している。恐ろしい人間たちを警戒しながら―","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blte23b91958a7479bf/631a8b92251b540e0aea78ac/960_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltcd0d5eb4b44d35f1/631a8b92e7bdcf0dd996c8e5/1600_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltac77c0e793cedb9d/631a8b923ab6f40dd2a906b1/2600_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/4ede795c2a681aaccfa72d0c901cba0cb8a2c292fd6a97b2ba9faed161c2d184.png","role":"damage","subrole":"specialist","location":"スウェーデン、ヨーテボリ","birthday":"Unknown","age":32,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"armor":100,"health":250,"total":350},"abilities":[{"name":"強襲モード","description":"強力なガトリング砲に変形するが、移動速度が低下する","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/c3391c7eb4ce0ac2483d1821299fa684072e2ace043ac6ae7839f81f09c187f9.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt8cd68d463a5bf298/6333a53b2dc7636608cc706a/BASTION_CONFIGURATION_ASSAULT..jpg","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt46bc8c9dc2698970/6333a4ee1a0b5e7d3d1ec4c5/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_BastionConfiguration-Assault_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_H264.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt96b6df4d081e3492/66798f5791d53b2446dc0615/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_BastionConfiguration-Assault_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_H264.webm"}}},{"name":"偵察モード","description":"軽量で精密な武器を構え、身軽に移動できる","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/9febc039b8d8f7743539e8743f78b15495e3ea619615ab763dc747acd29b9615.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaiz